{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0153_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "587fc6fdf0437156ffa9722fcc34518b69f229e297704e5066af1a13c71ba702", "ja": "ばか……。のり子のばか……！\nう～ん、もっと強く言った方がいいかな……。", "zh": "笨蛋……德莉子的笨蛋……！\n嗯～是不是应该说得再重一点呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
