{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0153_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4ceb884fae9c3b8fac2647659890613768efd864fbd9e05818995dca3038e13a", "ja": "この声は……桃子か？\nちょうどよかった。MVの打ち合わせを……。", "zh": "这个声音是……桃子吗？\n正好。来商量一下MV的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
