{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0153_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "ddf1d2475f3b9feb2f5effd1a51f32f158c74621cf41bdc50472aaf69ac8fbbd", "ja": "あ、あれ？　……お兄ちゃん？", "zh": "啊，咦？……哥哥？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0153_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "8e121a65f5ab20f4dbb13b2d5a4e172505c971c7524b0939e3f4e3c29a184e39", "ja": "もう、急に入って来ないで！\n集中が途切れちゃったじゃない！", "zh": "真是的，别突然闯进来啊！\n害我都不能集中注意力了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0153_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d33af77787cab8b7e25f5ac88d7782be390ce7c9d7c68632bcbc9f486bc49e41", "ja": "ご、ごめん。ノックはしたんだけど……。\nそれより、今のは『お嬢』のセリフか？", "zh": "对、对不起。我敲过门了，只是……\n先不说这个，刚才那句是“小公主”的台词吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0153_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "bf51f549c84aecc74cdb87775cdec9f2a230609bbef438c0e75b76b2fbea3b67", "ja": "そうだよ、練習してるの。\nだって『俠気乱舞』のMV作るんでしょ？", "zh": "对啊，我在练习呢。\n因为要制作《侠气乱舞》的MV吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0153_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "12f6b64a1e17406c4c805576ad4cfd6fbb5c81c40b76dd022aa1120aa95d92d1", "ja": "あれは、映画の主題歌なんだから。お客さんに、\n歌と映画、両方のいいところを伝えなくちゃ。", "zh": "那可是电影的主题曲啊。必须要向观众\n传达出歌曲和电影这两方面的魅力才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0153_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "0caf9f07a8cfbac88d5a995d6d31b04479b9b4af26c35fc304d31646597acf44", "ja": "そのためには、桃子もちゃんと役作りをして、\nお嬢の気持ちになっておかないとね。", "zh": "为此，桃子也得好好揣摩角色，先设身处地体会大小姐的心情才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0153_1015_p", "source_sha256": "bc3ff5ed462dccddeeaaef6aa763882bde0054f1cd97ee9d9aa990ece72834c1", "ja": "なるほど、そうだったのか。\nそれで衣装まで……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。  \n连服装都……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0153_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "b7cb2468ecb2be8aa7d1e3d01492a2e95343ba09d36147feaae6b53f6854008c", "ja": "こ……これは、ちょっと着てみただけ！\n別にいいでしょ！", "zh": "这……这只是稍微试穿了一下！\n没什么吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0153_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "acca00bcf86a972006335989d05ad27c45e4f72e09bdb6c7e48bd2f427fd5bcc", "ja": "とにかく！　映画の撮影から時間経っちゃったし、\n桃子は練習で忙しいの。ジャマしないで！", "zh": "总之！电影拍摄结束后都过了这么久，\n桃子还忙着练习呢。别来打扰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0153_1018_p", "source_sha256": "47ca6fa08670e7c73d1e45b76c505db6e5dfb592095b013d5e4bc10cb78cc7ca", "ja": "わかった。それじゃ、『俠気乱舞』の\nMVの打ち合わせは、また今度にしよう。", "zh": "知道了。那就等下次再商量\n《侠气乱舞》MV的事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0153_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "f84ac6bf47b856afa465446c7754df194c6b09b793143a039cc73132796dfc8c", "ja": "えっ？\n……MVの打ち合わせだったの？", "zh": "诶？\n……原来是MV的讨论会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0153_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "abe9913f308d04885ca26a2ecdb1329f73042f3c61a521e0de3c05f350b62150", "ja": "それなら桃子、聞いてもいいかな。\n役作りの参考になるかもしれないし……。", "zh": "那样的话，桃子可以问问吗？说不定能作为塑造角色的参考……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
